{"seq":2,"slug":"auto-scroll","title":"边缘自动滚动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-drag-drop-interactions/behaviors/auto-scroll","wordCount":1418,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"边缘自动滚动\">边缘自动滚动</h1><p>要把一张卡片从看板的第一列拖到最后一列，而最后一列在屏幕右侧看不见的地方，用户该怎么办？答案是：当拖拽物逼近可视区边缘，界面自动朝那个方向滚动，把目标区域送进视野。这个&quot;边缘自动滚动&quot;（edge auto-scroll）功能听起来是锦上添花，缺了它，任何超过一屏的拖放都会卡死。它的实现却是拖放里最容易做得&quot;手感糟糕&quot;的一环——速度不跟手、方向判断错、嵌套容器里滚错层，都很常见。这一篇讲清楚它的机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-边缘滚动的四个要件\">核心概念：边缘滚动的四个要件</h2><p>自动滚动要做对，靠四个要件协同，本篇逐一展开：<strong>边缘检测</strong>（判断拖拽物是否进入某侧的触发带）、<strong>速度曲线</strong>（越靠边缘滚得越快，且要平滑而非突变）、<strong>动画帧循环</strong>（用 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code> 持续驱动滚动，而非依赖 <code>pointermove</code> 的离散触发）、以及<strong>嵌套容器</strong>（多层可滚动祖先里，决定该滚哪一层）。四者缺一，手感就会破。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边缘检测-定义触发带\">边缘检测：定义触发带</h2><p>自动滚动的第一步是判断&quot;该不该滚&quot;。做法是在滚动容器的四条边内侧各划一条宽度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>（典型 40–60px）的<strong>触发带</strong>（activation zone）。拖拽物（或指针）落入某条触发带，就朝那个方向滚动。以垂直方向为例，设容器可视区上边界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>top</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{top}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">top</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、下边界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>bottom</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{bottom}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bottom</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，指针纵坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>top</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_y &lt; c_{\\text{top}} + t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8252em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">top</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>：进入上触发带，向上滚。</li>\n<li>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>bottom</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_y &gt; c_{\\text{bottom}} - t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8252em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bottom</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>：进入下触发带，向下滚。</li>\n<li>两者之间：不滚。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>触发带太窄，用户很难精准命中、滚动难触发；太宽，正常拖放会被误触发成滚动。40–60px 是兼顾指针精度与误触的经验值，触摸场景可略宽。</p>\n<h2 id=\"速度曲线-越靠边越快\">速度曲线：越靠边越快</h2><p>最影响手感的是滚动速度。如果一进触发带就以固定速度猛滚，会失控；正确做法是让速度随&quot;深入触发带的程度&quot;平滑增长——刚踏进边缘慢慢滚，贴到最边缘才最快。定义归一化深度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u \\in [0, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 在触发带内沿，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 在容器边缘），速度为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = v_{\\max} \\cdot u^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>平方（甚至三次）曲线让靠内侧的滚动格外温柔、贴边时才提速，比线性手感好得多。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 常设为每帧十几到二十几像素。这条&quot;缓入&quot;曲线的设计思路，和动画缓动函数同源，可对照<a href=\"../../web-animation/performance/pipeline-and-compositor\">《渲染管线与合成器》</a>理解为何要在合成友好的前提下驱动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动画帧循环-滚动必须自驱动\">动画帧循环：滚动必须自驱动</h2><p>这是最容易犯的架构错误：把滚动写在 <code>pointermove</code> 回调里。问题在于——<strong>指针不动时不派发 <code>pointermove</code></strong>。用户把拖拽物拖到边缘后静止不动，期望列表持续滚动，但 <code>pointermove</code> 停了，滚动也就停了，手感彻底破裂。</p>\n<p>正解是开一个独立的 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code> 循环：一旦检测到进入触发带就启动，此后每帧根据当前速度调整 <code>scrollTop</code>/<code>scrollLeft</code>，直到拖拽物离开触发带或拖拽结束才停。指针坐标由 <code>pointermove</code> 更新到共享变量，滚动循环只读它。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[pointermove: 更新指针坐标] --&gt; B{在触发带内?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是, 循环未启动| C[启动 rAF 滚动循环]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D[停止循环]&#10;  C --&gt; E[每帧: 按深度算速度 v]&#10;  E --&gt; F[scrollTop += v]&#10;  F --&gt; G[容器滚动, 缓存的 droppable rect 失效]&#10;  G --&gt; H[重建 rect, 重跑命中检测]&#10;  H --&gt; E\">flowchart TD\n  A[pointermove: 更新指针坐标] --&gt; B{在触发带内?}\n  B --&gt;|是, 循环未启动| C[启动 rAF 滚动循环]\n  B --&gt;|否| D[停止循环]\n  C --&gt; E[每帧: 按深度算速度 v]\n  E --&gt; F[scrollTop += v]\n  F --&gt; G[容器滚动, 缓存的 droppable rect 失效]\n  G --&gt; H[重建 rect, 重跑命中检测]\n  H --&gt; E</pre><p>注意图里关键的一环：<strong>每次滚动都会让缓存的 droppable 几何过期</strong>。命中检测（见<a href=\"../mechanics/hit-detection\">《命中检测与碰撞》</a>）依赖的 rect 是相对视口的，容器一滚，所有目标的视口坐标都变了。所以自动滚动循环里必须在滚动后重建 rect 缓存或改用容器内相对坐标，否则拖拽物会&quot;命中错目标&quot;。这正是<a href=\"../foundations/dnd-model\">《拖放数据模型》</a>里强调&quot;滚动使几何缓存过期&quot;的实战场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"嵌套滚动容器-滚哪一层\">嵌套滚动容器：滚哪一层</h2><p>现实页面常有多层可滚动祖先：一个可滚的看板列，嵌在可滚的看板画布里，画布又在可滚的页面里。拖拽物到达边缘时，该滚哪个？</p>\n<p>策略通常是<strong>从最内层可滚容器向外冒泡</strong>：先看拖拽物所在的最近可滚祖先能否朝该方向继续滚（未到尽头），能就滚它；已滚到头，才把滚动意图交给上一层祖先。这需要沿 DOM 向上收集所有 <code>overflow: auto/scroll</code> 的祖先，判断各自的 <code>scrollTop</code>/<code>scrollHeight</code> 余量。下表是常见容器组合的处理：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>容器结构</th>\n<th>拖到内层底部</th>\n<th>拖到外层底部</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单层列表</td>\n<td>滚列表</td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列表嵌看板</td>\n<td>先滚列表</td>\n<td>列表到底后滚看板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>看板嵌页面</td>\n<td>先滚看板</td>\n<td>看板到底后滚 window</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判断&quot;是否可滚容器&quot;时别忘了排除 <code>overflow: hidden</code> 和内容未溢出的元素，否则会挑错层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自动滚动让超过一屏的拖放成为可能，缺了它任何跨屏拖放都会卡死。</li>\n<li>边缘检测在容器四边内侧划 40–60px 触发带，太窄难命中、太宽易误触。</li>\n<li>速度随深入触发带的程度按平方曲线平滑增长（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = v_{\\max} u^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9641em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），比线性或固定速度手感好得多。</li>\n<li>滚动必须由独立 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code> 循环自驱动，不能挂在 <code>pointermove</code> 上，否则指针静止时滚动停摆。</li>\n<li>每次滚动使 droppable 几何缓存过期，必须重建后再命中检测；嵌套容器从最内层向外冒泡决定滚哪层。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>上一篇：<a href=\"sortable-reorder\">《排序与重排》</a> —— 长列表排序依赖自动滚动把目标滚进视口。</li>\n<li>下一篇：<a href=\"constraints-axes\">《约束与轴锁》</a> —— 给自由拖拽加上规矩。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../web-animation/performance/pipeline-and-compositor\">《渲染管线与合成器》</a> —— 帧循环与合成层的性能基础。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"边缘自动滚动","id":"边缘自动滚动"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：边缘滚动的四个要件","id":"核心概念-边缘滚动的四个要件"},{"level":2,"text":"边缘检测：定义触发带","id":"边缘检测-定义触发带"},{"level":2,"text":"速度曲线：越靠边越快","id":"速度曲线-越靠边越快"},{"level":2,"text":"动画帧循环：滚动必须自驱动","id":"动画帧循环-滚动必须自驱动"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌套滚动容器：滚哪一层","id":"嵌套滚动容器-滚哪一层"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"排序与重排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-drag-drop-interactions/behaviors/sortable-reorder"},"next":{"title":"约束与轴锁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-drag-drop-interactions/behaviors/constraints-axes"}}